# #190 dash-jump cross-up: Rifleman a dashes at a shielding Rifleman b from 40 Melee
# units away, short hops out of the dash holding forward, and back airs. The
# jump keeps the dash's speed (1.70 Melee units a frame), carries a over b and
# the back air meets b's shield from behind (44 units past b's centre in the
# headless run; smashcraft:ts/test/air-drift.test.ts holds the same scenario
# for every fighter). Syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero rifleman
# b runs in to 240 away, stops and holds its shield.
40 b stick -1 0
46 b stick 0 0
70 b shield 1
# a dashes 8 frames, short hops (jump released in the squat) and back airs on the way down.
100 a stick 1 0
108 a tap B 2
124 a cstick -1 0
128 a cstick 0 0
160 a stick 0 0
200 b shield 0
# Expected, frame by frame (headless run of this script): the jump, the back air, and no damage to the shielding b.
#! expect a 111 applied jump 1
#! expect a 124 applied attack 1 style 14
#! absent b 100-200 damage
# View held a second: the moment the parity check replays.
300 a press VIEW
370 a release VIEW
